    "Wikipedia, Mercedes-AMG G 63 6x6: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercedes-AMG_G_63_6x6",
    "Wikipedia, Mercedes-Benz G-Class: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercedes-Benz_G-Class",
